  "foaf:name": "Ocean Culture: port to port and Water Cycle",
  "sdo:name": "Ocean Culture: port to port and Water Cycle",
  "sdo:description": "In contribution to the extension of Educational Events with Sailing School (Tall) Ships and with the support of the Blue School Network, to continue promoting the growth of this international community, through mixed webinars in their host ports (and upstream of the Water Cycle) to Ocean Literacy, especially dedicated to the following blue curriculum: finance, carbon, economics and governance.",
